# TODO

## Testing and local verification

- [ ] Add table-driven packet builders and fixtures for header/FlowSet length
  boundaries, truncation, padding, unknown fields, template replacement and
  expiry, multiple observation domains, options semantics, and all documented
  error paths.
- [ ] Add deterministic clock, concurrency, and lifecycle coverage for concurrent
  processing/flushing, repeated aging start/stop, and bounded cache behavior.
  Replace timing sleeps with an injectable or controllable clock where tests
  require deterministic time.
- [ ] Expand the runnable C example to cover decode-only callbacks, callback
  field values, null/empty inputs, and explicit timestamps.
- [ ] Keep benchmark workloads representative and runnable locally; cover packet
  size, records per packet, template warmness, cache hit/miss behavior, and
  cold versus warm contexts. Record environment details when comparing runs.
- [ ] Add a packet-parser fuzz crate with checked-in seeds for headers, FlowSets,
  templates, and variable-length records. Add optional sanitizer and dependency
  audit commands when the required tools and policies are defined.
- [ ] Add sanitizer/Miri coverage where supported for unsafe FFI lifecycle and
  concurrency paths.

